Deploy your containerized Flask app to Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)

Step 1: Create deployment.yaml
Step 2: Create service.yaml
Step 3: Apply YAMLs to AKS
CMD: az aks get-credentials --resource-group (Resource Group Name) --name (Cluster Name)
Step 4: Check Pod Status
CMD: kubectl get pods
Step 5: Describe a Pod
CMD: kubectl describe pod <pod-name> > describe-output.txt
